<sense id="f1082e11-3bfb-41ed-91bf-51edb82ec914">
<grammatical-info value="Noun">
</grammatical-info>
<gloss lang="en"><text>plant_type</text></gloss>
<definition>
<form lang="en"><text>a strong smelling plant whose bark, called ttäbe kollop, was traditionally worn around the neck to give fragrance and perfume smell. It was sometimes chewed and rubbed around the body and head to stop headache. The orignal purpose was also for protection from evil spirits.</text></form>
</definition>
