<definition>
<form lang="en"><text>type of introduced banana</text></form>
<form lang="kit"><text>Ulle dan, obo däg a yuwog dag. Käp a o me otnan ma dag, ine ttänttämang e säpall ma dag. Kire da yu ma dag otnan e. Ako nge mubine da ngasnges ma dan mer mokowang e. (It's big; its bunches are plentiful. <span lang="en">When ripe, its fruit is eaten; </span>it's put in boiling water. <span lang="en">When unripe, it's cooked to be eaten. </span>Unripe fruit are cooked to eat. It's also for making a tasty mubine.)</text></form>
</definition>
