<form lang="kit"><text>Obom dandämoyän ttu we, angde obom ttu we dandämoyän bogo ddone dängllawän, be bogo gonddämän. </text></form>
<translation type="Free translation">
<form lang="en"><text>She pushed him into the deep, and when she pushed him into the deep, he didn't swim; he drowned.</text></form>
</translation>
<note type="reference">
<form lang="kit"><text><span href="silfw://localhost/link?tool%3dinterlinearEdit%26guid%3d265660f7-6638-4799-84b7-9c6617830d13%26tag%3d" class="Hyperlink">WE-ST010 2.2</span></text></form>
