<trait name="do-not-publish-in" value="Verbal Dictionary"/>
<sense id="0345e0a6-97a1-44f0-b9e3-fafd644fe74a">
<grammatical-info value="Verb">
<trait name="type" value="inflAffix"/>
<trait name="Verb-slot" value="Patient"/></grammatical-info>
<gloss lang="en"><text>VEN</text></gloss>
<definition>
<form lang="en"><text>venitive prefix</text></form>
</definition>
<trait name="do-not-publish-in" value="Verbal Dictionary"/>
<example source="WE-ST025 24.1">
<form lang="kit"><text>A atka gogon, [obo obo känae] obo känaebag ingäsmäll.</text></form>
<translation type="Free translation">
<form lang="en"><text>And he said, "Come back tomorrow."</text></form>
</translation>
<note type="reference">
<form lang="kit"><text><span href="silfw://localhost/link?tool%3dinterlinearEdit%26guid%3d921015b1-b473-4c3f-b175-8d186dcd8b90%26tag%3d" class="Hyperlink">WE-ST025 24.1</span></text></form>
</note>
<trait name="do-not-publish-in" value="Verbal Dictionary"/>
</example>
<example source="WE-ST025 46.1">
<form lang="kit"><text>Llɨg a ddone ako dingäsmällän Bundae bälle yagyag.</text></form>
<translation type="Free translation">
<form lang="en"><text>The boys didn't return to Bundae.</text></form>
</translation>
<note type="reference">
<form lang="kit"><text><span href="silfw://localhost/link?tool%3dinterlinearEdit%26guid%3d921015b1-b473-4c3f-b175-8d186dcd8b90%26tag%3d" class="Hyperlink">WE-ST025 46.1</span></text></form>
</note>
<trait name="do-not-publish-in" value="Verbal Dictionary"/>
</example>
<example source="WE-ST020 1.36">
<form lang="kit"><text>Däräng käsre dallän do ma we gogon, a täl pallkoll de diwenyän, käsre [adaka] adaka gänyaolle nagda Baet bo llan de täräpnan anggan. </text></form>
<translation type="Free translation">
<form lang="en"><text>Dog then went to his house, and brought a piece of bamboo. Then, he cut his friend Cuscus's ears.</text></form>
</translation>
<note type="reference">
<form lang="kit"><text><span href="silfw://localhost/link?tool%3dinterlinearEdit%26guid%3dfeb7ed85-2d60-495d-9b7b-d9ad70c5bf40%26tag%3d" class="Hyperlink">WE-ST020 1.36</span></text></form>
</note>
<trait name="do-not-publish-in" value="Verbal Dictionary"/>
</example>
<example source="SE-TN016 40.3">
<form lang="kit"><text>Dindugän, do täl pallkoll dingällbällnän.</text></form>
<translation type="Free translation">
<form lang="en"><text>He ran and got a piece of bamboo.</text></form>
</translation>
<note type="reference">
<form lang="kit"><text><span href="silfw://localhost/link?tool%3dinterlinearEdit%26guid%3d530da1eb-e55d-4b77-9f4d-eb3895ff4165%26tag%3d" class="Hyperlink">SE-TN016 40.3</span></text></form>
</note>
<trait name="do-not-publish-in" value="Verbal Dictionary"/>
</example>
<reversal type="en"><form lang="en"><text>VEN</text></form>
</reversal>
<illustration href="">
</illustration></sense>
</entry>
