<form lang="kit"><text>Ttänttam itrell me kutt de otnan ma dag a ako ttam utt de sespen ma dag id nanen e. (<span lang="en">When sick with malaria, the seeds are eaten, and the young leaves are boiled so the extract can be drunk.)</span></text></form>
</definition>
