<form lang="en"><text>type of introduced banana</text></form>
<form lang="kit"><text>Mer wup dan, obo käp a kumäddäga ngallen me yu ma dag, ada o me otänan ma dag, ako o da yu mi binzenen ma dag, a kire da yu ma dag. (It's a good banana; its fruit are cooked in three ways; when ripe, they're eaten and heated on the fire, and when unripe, they are cooked.)</text></form>
