</definition>
<trait name="do-not-publish-in" value="Verbal Dictionary"/>
<example>
<form lang="kit"><text>Da bongo mäse dowae me o utale me nänttam, ddone mɨnyi bongllaeyän adawatta obo llan a ttomoll dageyo.</text></form>
<translation type="Free translation">
<form lang="en"><text>If you tried to call him, from near or far, he would not answer because he was deaf in his ears. </text></form>
</translation>
<trait name="do-not-publish-in" value="Verbal Dictionary"/>
</example>
<example>
<form lang="kit"><text>Kaya walle do Upiara ttängämang a ttaem nallo.</text></form>
