</grammatical-info>
<gloss lang="en"><text>coconut</text></gloss>
<definition>
<form lang="en"><text>coconut</text></form>
<form lang="kit"><text>Wätät ulle dan, nge ine da dädär a lla da ibeny eran. (It's an important food; when the coconut water is dry, people plant it.)</text></form>
</definition>
