<definition>
<form lang="en"><text>type of introduced banana</text></form>
<form lang="kit"><text>Tupi pänyanzag dan. Obo pätt a ulle dan a däg a obo yuwog dag käp peyang. O me käp a binzenen ma dag ako kire me yu ma dag. Ako pätt a obo popel e kaepnen ma da ankom peyang a pag a diba toko me mer mokowang e. (It grows long. Its trunk is big and its bunches have plentiful fruit. <span lang="en">When ripe, its fruit is heated, and when unripe, it's cooked. Also, its stem is for chewing popel, with ants and salt on top to make it delicious.)</span></text></form>
</definition>
